      "source_text": "即便被怀疑是冒牌圣女，\n她依然没有失去作为圣女的信念……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59d8d72a01fe6e232c34f3d4e517f72e88471651447f082002b6ed68b29267d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
