    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a6144a2b2630cff518415b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若想跨越这些试炼，\n仅凭半吊子的觉悟可不行。\n必须贯彻身为圣女的信念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b761b08ae9986c9b58205e97ab2119ab264f1b66ed8fadf0e598d1c6b44216",
