    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61987dffffb98b076902c7e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我歪着头表示还以为自己是在接受考验，\n红色梦想也同样\n歪了歪头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d223f5970ab2fdcae966ba410159858acf8e516a24f93f3196f9337de3140733",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
